Parsing API Data
First, we’ll do a test process using the example URL from the rubric.

censusKey&lt;-readRDS("../censusKey.rds")
baseUrl &lt;- "https://api.census.gov/data/2024/acs/acs1/pums"

apiEx &lt;- GET(
  url=baseUrl,
  query=list(
    get="SEX,PWGTP,JWAP",
    `for`="state:01,02",
    SCHL="24",
    key=censusKey
  )
)
rawStats &lt;- content(apiEx, "text", encoding="UTF-8")
parsedStats &lt;- fromJSON(rawStats)
exampleStats &lt;- as_tibble(parsedStats)

